# Local render output (people render charts into their own folders)
/out/
/output/
*-demo/
*.gif.tmp

# The bundled fonts and Levels logo PNG under skills/levels-charts/assets/ ARE committed
# on purpose — they make the skill's core look self-contained (no downloads). Company
# logos are NOT: they're fetched on demand from logo.dev and cached locally
# (see skills/levels-charts/references/company-logos.md).
skills/levels-charts/assets/company_logos/*
!skills/levels-charts/assets/company_logos/.gitkeep
